# Tiny spec class — first listable job type. Weight = 1.

Goal:
Serve one tiny-class inference request within a 2048 output token budget and a 2000 ms SLA

Constraint:
Model hash must equal tiny-model-v0
Constraint:
Chain stores hashes only

Risk:
Worker returns a different model than tiny-model-v0
Recovery:
Reject settlement and slash miner bond to the payer
Risk:
Output exceeds the 2048 token budget
Recovery:
Set quality to zero and allow slash on challenge

Layer:
TinyInference

Validation:
Proof of Origin verifies against this spec hash
Validation:
Billed output tokens never exceed 2048

Behavior BoundOutput
    Input: token_out, budget_out
    Output: billed
    Action:
        billed = token_out
        if billed > budget_out:
            billed = budget_out
        return billed
